{"Version":1,"ProgramText":"INKG Red\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nINKG \u0022Green\u0022\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nINKG #0000FF\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nINKG \u0022#FF00FF\u0022\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nINKG 5\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nI=14\nINKG I\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nA$=\u0022#FF4444\u0022\nINKG A$\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\n\nFOR I = 1 TO 15\n    a$=\u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNO\u0022\n    INKG I\n    b$ = MID$(a$,i,1)\n\tPRINTG b$,\nNEXT I\n\nPRINTG\n\nFOR I = 1 TO 15\n    a$=\u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNO\u0022\n    col = \u0022#FF\u0022 \u0026 Hex(I) \u0026 Hex(I) \u0026 Hex(I) \u0026 Hex(I)\n    INKG col\n    b$ = MID$(a$,i,1)\n\tPRINTG b$,\nNEXT I\n\n\nINKG GREEN\nFOR I=0 TO 639\n  PLOT I,SIN(I)*240\u002B240\nNEXT I","ScreenWidth":640,"ScreenHeight":480,"Sprites":[],"MapWidth":1,"MapHeight":1,"MapData":[-1]}